The exact bundled versions and source locations are listed in NOTICE.
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt reproduces notices for Redis's statically linked
libraries and FalkorDB's pinned third-party dependencies.

The falkordblite TypeScript wrapper (the "falkordblite" npm package) is a
separate work licensed under the MIT License; it runs redis-server as a
separate process and communicates with it over a socket. Its MIT license
does not govern Redis, FalkorDB, or their embedded dependencies.
